Z||000000||KnightRyder31||04-28-2000||01:57 PM||||Do you guys like car chase movies? Well if you do, I can recomend one to you....if you havent seen it yet. Its kind of old(1971), but it is the best chase movie ever. Its called Vanishing Point. I know this is out of the subject, but I just figured that if you guys like cars, you might like this. I love it, I watch it a lot. You guys should really rent it sometime. It has a bad A$$ car in it, a 70' Dodge Challenger R/T, with a 440ci engine, real fast. I normaly hate all cars that arent GM, but this Mopar is the $hit! Its 99 mins of pure car chase. Go rent it.<BR>-----Knight------||||reg||14
Z||000001||kong||04-28-2000||09:06 PM||||Yep, vanishing point is a good chase movie. But my favorite is Gone in sixty seconds. They're doing a remake of it It's going to be released soon. If it's half as good as the original I'm definately gonna go see it.||||reg||1
Z||000002||stimpy||04-28-2000||10:04 PM||||My vote for best chases in a movie (maybe not a "chase movie" exactly) would have to go for Ronin with Robert DeNiro!  Talk about destroying some high priced machinery! Maybe not the quantity of "Gone in 60 seconds" but definately got it beat on quality of destruction!||||reg||1
Z||000003||KnightRyder31||04-29-2000||10:57 AM||||Yea guys, I'm also awaiting Gone In 60 Secs. It comes out June 6th. But I still feel that Vnishing Point is the best chase movie. Come on, what can beat 99 or 98 mins of 100% pure car chase? It also has a good story line, you probably wont understand unless you view it numorous times. Hey, wouldnt it be cool if someone made a chase movie with a V8 Fiero? I'd see it!<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000004||lowCG||04-29-2000||06:36 PM||||My favorite is still"Bullet",with Steve McQueen,will have to check that one out though,sounds familiar.<BR>Ronin is pretty neat also;those European motors sure make a sweet note,especially the BMW six.<BR>Some really good tire-squealing-viewing can be found on last years Pro Rally video.||||reg||1
Z||000005||KnightRyder31||04-29-2000||07:20 PM||||Your right, Bullet is a sweet film. You have to see Vanishing Point....it is a great flick, two thumbs up.<BR>-----Knight-----||||reg||14
