Z||000009||batboy||04-30-2000||11:37 AM||||Vanishing Point was practically a gearhead cult movie back when I was in high school. Hey, what was the name of the old 70's cop movie that had an awesome chase through San Fran? I think the good guys were driving a Pontiac, whatever was similar to a Nova, (Ventura?). In one scene, a guy in a parked car opens the door as the chase goes by. One of the cars hits the door, which is ripped off and toss into the air like a kite. Don't know if it's true, but I heard that was an accident, an innocent bystander had no idea they were filming a chase when he opened the door. Never heard if he got hurt. Man, that'd be a surprise (and maybe a lawsuit). Another cool oldie flick about street racing a 57 Chevy was Two Lane Blacktop.||||reg||1
